  "reasoning": "The defendant repeatedly gave secret cash rebates (totaling 790,000 yuan) to the head of a department in a public hospital to secure sales of medical consumables. This conduct meets the statutory elements of the crime of offering bribes to a public official (行贿罪) under the Criminal Law of the People’s Republic of China. No other distinct criminal conduct is described, so only this offense applies.",
